All the best with {{business.name}}.

Best regards,', ARRAY['business.name', 'contact.firstName']::text[], 'active', true, '[]'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
--> statement-breakpoint
INSERT INTO "email_templates" ("id", "organization_id", "key", "name", "purpose", "offer", "locale", "version", "subject_variants", "body_md", "variables", "status", "seeded", "lint") VALUES ('01a149c7-82b3-721c-9115-782e5469c594', NULL, 'reply_price', 'Reply to a price question', 'reply', 'website_redesign', 'en', 1, ARRAY['Your question about pricing', 'Pricing for {{business.name}}’s website', '{{business.name}}: getting you a clear quote']::text[], '{{#if contact.firstName}}Hello {{contact.firstName}},{{else}}Hello,{{/if}}

Thanks for asking, and it is a fair question. The honest answer is that it depends on scope: how many pages, whether you need online booking or a shop, the text and photos, and the languages. A one-page site and a full rebuild are very different projects.

Rather than guess, could we take 15 minutes on a call? I will ask a few questions and then send you a clear written quote.

Best regards,', ARRAY['business.name', 'contact.firstName']::text[], 'active', true, '[{"code":"too_long","severity":"warning","message":"81 words; keep it under 80","at":"body"}]'::jsonb) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
